Description: Submit and monitor batch execution of R programs across
    distributed computing backends including Kubernetes, SLURM, and Posit
    Workbench. Provides end-user job submission functions, cluster interface
    functions using 'kubectl' and SLURM commands, and a 'plumber' API
    template for secure identity segregation. Supports parallel and
    sequential batch execution, file-based caching to skip unchanged
    programs, and 'logrx' integration for execution logging.
